WEBVTT

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.480
Wolves die, pigs die.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.240
Day 5

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:21.910
2nd Floor, Kunagisa Tomo's Room

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:24.780
You son of a bitch!

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:28.250
It's all your fault! You bastard! You unbelievable bastard!

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.660
It's happening again.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:33.500
Too much.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:38.140
It's all too much! No more, no more!

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:41.420
Why? Why? Damn it, why!?

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.860
Calm down, Akari. What happened?

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:56.860
Sorry. I apologize. I lost control.

00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:00.660
It's not your fault...

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:02.160
I know...

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.900
It's not your fault.

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:07.160
I don't mind, really.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:12.520
But what happened? Please, tell me. If something happened...

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:17.840
Come to the first floor storeroom.

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:22.760
The first floor storeroom?

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.660
Wake up, Tomo.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.960
Morning', Ii-chan.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.220
Put my hair up?

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.980
No time for that, Tomo.

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:39.740
Then I don't have to wash my face?

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:47.500
What I lack is everything you have

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:54.630
What I want to be is everything you want

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:58.220
The moment we first met

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.760
I'm sure I already knew

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:06.100
Even before it began

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.850
Behind my words

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:12.860
I'm always hiding

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:18.110
Keeping my feelings buried deep

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:32.040
Now, the world that keeps us trapped sure changes before you know it

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:41.220
I mean my heart's already dyed a single color,
in my mind the answer's already been chosen

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:47.680
Is it fate? I don't know, but I'll reach out my hand

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:51.400
I bet we don't need words at all

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:55.270
Your melody and my rhythm

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:59.860
Clamp up our feelings and spin out our fingers

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:03.200
I'll always be right here

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:09.080
<i>The Beheading Cycle</i>

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:09.080
<i>The Blue Savant and
the Master of Nonsense</i>

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:07.080
